    brand: "Titan Fitness",
    category: "Dedicated 35-degree plate-loaded hack squat",
    badge: "Best Dedicated Hack Squat",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Titan+Fitness+Plate-Loaded+Linear+Hack+Squat+Machine&tag=sktiger-20",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: null,
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "About $975",
    priceBounds: {"low":975,"high":975},
    specs: "Maker figures: 35° carriage · 700 lb capacity · linear bearings · 46.75 x 60.5 in. footprint · 190 lb",
    pros: [
      "A dedicated hack squat for under $1,000",
      "Linear bearings on steel guide rods, per Titan",
      "Flip-up racking handles you work without leaving the machine",
      "Compact and light for a plate-loaded sled, by Titan’s figures",
